# Testing Conventions

Load and follow `.agents/skills/bottom-up-testing/SKILL.md` whenever adding, changing, or reviewing tests.

The governing principle is bottom-up coverage: persistence tests prove database behavior, service/use-case tests prove business combinations, and handler/API tests prove transport integration and transport-owned validation. Do not use high-level tests to duplicate branches owned by lower layers.

